WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.647
Have you seen these seabirds before?

2
00:00:02.648 --> 00:00:04.869
They are emperor penguins.

3
00:00:04.870 --> 00:00:07.621
They look very dressed up, don't they?

4
00:00:07.622 --> 00:00:11.942
These emperor penguins are playing and catching fish in the ocean.

5
00:00:11.943 --> 00:00:15.390
But what do they do when the wind gets colder?

6
00:00:15.391 --> 00:00:21.603
"Brr! Winter must be around the corner!" says one emperor penguin.

7
00:00:21.604 --> 00:00:26.121
"Yes, it is time to lay our egg," says the other.

8
00:00:26.122 --> 00:00:29.373
"Oh, I can't wait to be a father!"

9
00:00:29.374 --> 00:00:34.629
So the two emperor penguins swim to the frozen shore of Antarctica.

10
00:00:34.630 --> 00:00:37.148
The weather is bitterly cold.

11
00:00:37.149 --> 00:00:40.629
The father finds shelter under an ice cliff.

12
00:00:40.630 --> 00:00:43.925
Then the mother emperor penguin lays her egg.

13
00:00:43.926 --> 00:00:46.969
"Dear, you did such a good job!

14
00:00:46.970 --> 00:00:49.001
Look at our beautiful egg!

15
00:00:49.002 --> 00:00:53.031
Quick, roll it onto my feet so I can keep it warm."

16
00:00:53.032 --> 00:00:57.387
The father emperor penguin carefully balances the egg on his feet.

17
00:00:57.388 --> 00:01:00.680
He makes sure the egg doesn't touch the ice.

18
00:01:00.681 --> 00:01:06.034
To keep the egg warm, he covers it with the extra skin over his stomach.

19
00:01:06.035 --> 00:01:09.213
"Now head out to sea to eat and rest.

20
00:01:09.214 --> 00:01:12.674
You worked very hard," says the father.

21
00:01:12.675 --> 00:01:16.293
"I am very tired," says the mother penguin.

22
00:01:16.294 --> 00:01:18.562
"But I can stay on shore.

23
00:01:18.563 --> 00:01:21.450
I want to stay with you and our egg."

24
00:01:21.451 --> 00:01:24.490
But the father emperor penguin insists.

25
00:01:24.491 --> 00:01:26.962
"No, you go and rest.

26
00:01:26.963 --> 00:01:30.355
I will take care of our egg until you come back."

27
00:01:30.356 --> 00:01:32.818
"Okay, dear, I guess I will.

28
00:01:32.819 --> 00:01:38.971
Please stay warm and keep our egg safe!"

29
00:01:38.972 --> 00:01:43.399
After the mother penguin leaves, it gets colder and colder.

30
00:01:43.400 --> 00:01:48.431
The father emperor penguin and his friends huddle together to keep warm.

31
00:01:48.432 --> 00:01:51.785
They cannot leave their eggs to hunt or fish.

32
00:01:51.786 --> 00:01:56.227
They must sit on their eggs for nine long weeks.

33
00:01:56.228 --> 00:01:59.832
"Brr! Hey, are you guys okay?"

34
00:01:59.833 --> 00:02:02.595
"Brr! Yes, I am doing fine.

35
00:02:02.596 --> 00:02:05.054
But it is pretty cold, isn't it?"

36
00:02:05.055 --> 00:02:09.545
"Yep! And we have many more weeks to go. Brr!"

37
00:02:09.546 --> 00:02:14.328
"I am getting so hungry!" thinks the father emperor penguin.

38
00:02:14.329 --> 00:02:17.785
"But it's my job to guard the egg and keep it warm.

39
00:02:17.786 --> 00:02:20.647
I hope it survives the harsh winter."

40
00:02:20.648 --> 00:02:23.794
Finally the egg begins to hatch.

41
00:02:23.795 --> 00:02:29.886
"Cheep, cheep!" A fuzzy, gray emperor penguin peeps up at its father.

42
00:02:29.887 --> 00:02:32.007
"Look at my beautiful baby!

43
00:02:32.008 --> 00:02:35.139
I am so proud!"

44
00:02:35.140 --> 00:02:39.281
When the mother returns, she says, "Oh, how wonderful!

45
00:02:39.282 --> 00:02:41.658
Look at my fuzzy little chick!

46
00:02:41.659 --> 00:02:43.198
Thank you, dear.

47
00:02:43.199 --> 00:02:46.234
Now I am strong and rested again.

48
00:02:46.235 --> 00:02:48.582
But look how thin you are.

49
00:02:48.583 --> 00:02:51.893
You have not eaten for over nine weeks.

50
00:02:51.894 --> 00:02:53.786
Let's take turns.

51
00:02:53.787 --> 00:02:56.586
Now I can take care of our baby.

52
00:02:56.587 --> 00:02:58.810
You must eat and rest.

53
00:02:58.811 --> 00:03:03.234
Our baby will need a strong father to protect him."

54
00:03:03.235 --> 00:03:06.723
"You are right. I will be back soon."

55
00:03:06.724 --> 00:03:10.186
So the father emperor penguin heads to the ocean.

56
00:03:10.187 --> 00:03:14.423
While he is gone, the mother feeds and cares for the chick.

57
00:03:14.424 --> 00:03:18.154
Soon the father emperor penguin returns.

58
00:03:18.155 --> 00:03:23.420
"Are you strong and rested?" asks the mother emperor penguin.

59
00:03:23.421 --> 00:03:26.189
"Yes, I feel so much better now.

60
00:03:26.190 --> 00:03:29.851
Look what I brought you both from the ocean!"

61
00:03:29.852 --> 00:03:32.905
"A squid! My favorite!"

62
00:03:32.906 --> 00:03:35.692
"Cheep, cheep!" says the baby.

63
00:03:35.693 --> 00:03:38.040
It's his favorite too.

64
00:03:38.041 --> 00:03:41.440
The emperor penguins look so happy together!

65
00:03:41.441 --> 00:03:44.396
Isn't the emperor penguin family great?

